      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the implicit prefix that is applied when performing a lookup or <code>null</code>\nif no prefix is used. Prefixes can be used to disambiguate keys that would\notherwise clash. For example, if multiple applications are running on the same\nmachine a different prefix can be set on each application to ensure that different\nenvironment variables are used.",
      "translation": "返回执行查找时应用的隐式前缀，或者如果未使用前缀则返回`null`。可以使用前缀来消除键的歧义，否则这些键可能会发生冲突。例如，如果在同一台机器上运行多个应用程序，可以为每个应用程序设置不同的前缀，以确保使用不同的环境变量。",
      "count": 1
    },
